  DisplayName: Ozem Experience
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: You or someone close to you worked with the Knights of Ozem before
    Lastwall fell. In addition to knowledge of the organization's tenets and goals,
    you have germane understanding of the order's history. You believe there are
    valuable lessons in the Knights of Ozem's exploits. Choose two attribute boosts.
    One must be to Strength or Intelligence , and one is a free attribute boost.
    You're trained in the Society skill and the Warfare Lore skill. You gain the
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Courtly Graces] skill feat.
